#: ../../c-api/monitoring.rst:131
msgid ""
"Fire a ``STOP_ITERATION`` event. If ``value`` is an instance of :exc:"
"`StopIteration`, it is used. Otherwise, a new :exc:`StopIteration` instance "
"is created with ``value`` as its argument."
msgstr ""
